{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02355","headline":"杂歌谣辞 苏小小歌 · 温庭筠","name":"杂歌谣辞 苏小小歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"买莲莫破券，买酒莫解金。\n酒里春容抱离恨，水中莲子怀芳心。\n吴公女儿腰似束，家在钱塘小江曲。\n一自檀郎逐便风，门前春水年年绿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02355.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02355","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}